==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Fates Collide|Marowak|37}} from the {{TCG|Fates Collide}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Marowak}}.
*'''Bone Beatdown''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Unified Minds|Alolan Marowak|75}} from the {{TCG|Unified Minds}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

